  ["creature.cornelius-watson.mabjov2014"]={title="Cornelius Watson",subtitle="Criatura - MaBJoV - 2014",body="Pagina: 30\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ===\n\nTipo/Tamanho: humanoid / M\n\nCR: 12\n\nCA: 12/15\n\nPV: 154 (28d8 + 28)\n\nDeslocamento: walk: 30\n\nSTR 10 | DEX 14 | CON 12 | INT 20 | WIS 15 | CHA 16\n\nSalvamentos: \n\nPericias: \n\nIdiomas: Celestial, Common, Dwarvish, Gnomish, Halfling, Infernal\n\nResistencias: \n\n=== TRACOS ===\n\nMagic Resistance\n\nDoc Watson has advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.\n\nPortent {@recharge}\n\nWhen Doc Watson or a creature he can see makes an attack roll, a saving throw, or an ability check, Doc Watson can roll a d20 and choose to use this roll in place of the attack roll, saving throw, or ability check. This trait recharges after using the Spellcasting action.\n\n=== CONJURACAO ===\n\nSpellcasting\n\n=== ACOES ===\n\nMultiattack\n\nDoc Watson makes three Arcane Burst attacks.\n\nArcane Burst\n\nms,rs 9 to hit, reach 5 ft. or range 120 ft., one target. h32 (5d10 + 5) lightning damage."},
